OL,3,ACapsized tanker carrying 7,000 tonnes  
OL,4,Aof diesel to be towed away from Ibiza  
OL,6,FA tanker carrying up to 7,000 tonnes of
OL,7,Fdiesel which capsized off the holiday  
OL,8,Fisland of Ibiza on Thursday will be    
OL,9,Ftowed to the port of Cartagena,        
OL,10,Fofficials in Spain say.                
OL,12,FAll 17 of the Malta-registered Med     
OL,13,FEmre's crew members were rescued but   
OL,14,Fthe chief engineer later died in       
OL,15,Fhospital. Six people were treated for  
OL,16,Fminor injuries.                        
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
