OL,3,ACapsized tanker carrying 7,000 tonnes  
OL,4,Aof diesel to be towed away from Ibiza  
OL,6,FThere had been concerns of a major oil 
OL,7,Fspillage in the western Mediterranean  
OL,8,Fbut an inspection showed that the      
OL,9,Fship's fuel tanks are intact. An       
OL,10,Finvestigation is under way into what   
OL,11,Fhappened.                              
OL,13,FThe vessel had been travelling from    
OL,14,FAlgeciras near Gibraltar to Barcelona  
OL,15,Fand is expected to arrive in Cartagena 
OL,16,Fon Monday in what is being seen as a   
OL,17,Fchallenging rescue operation.          
